[4b] Regression diagnostics (linearity, homoscedasticity, normality)...
  --- Regression diagnostics (Tim's mouse cortical culture) ---
  Normality of TE (actual, log2 scale, n=3,211): skew = 0.300, excess kurtosis = 1.471, D'Agostino K^2 p = 9.43e-34, Jarque-Bera p = 4.99e-74
  Normality of residuals: skew = -0.029, excess kurtosis = 1.520, D'Agostino K^2 p = 9.94e-25, Jarque-Bera p = 6.14e-68
  Homoscedasticity (Breusch-Pagan): LM stat = 151.695, p = 1.1e-09
  Linearity (Ramsey RESET, power=3 on fitted values): F = 15.190, p = 2.72e-07
  (in each test, p < 0.05 => reject the null of normality / homoscedasticity / linearity)
